{#- HOME'S OPENING (sectionKinds.js homeHero): the line above, the logo, the
    headline and the line under it. Fixed to Home and to the top: the logo is
    the arcade's five-tap door (.wordmark) and fail.js takes it apart piece by
    piece, so it is never anywhere else. -#}
{%- set wd = sec.words %}
<header class="hero hero-center"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="cue rise">{{ t | w(wd.cue) | rich(wd.cue) }}</div>
  {#- THE LOGO, CENTERED (Chase, 2026-10-15, canvas round 6 "Home · logo
      centered": "We decided on Logo centered … Animate it in. And make sure
      the letters and lines are all separate so that the page degradation
      for the arcade entrance still works"). Every letter and line is its
      own shape (brand/logo-split.njk); it assembles as the page opens; the
      arcade's five-tap door is still .wordmark, and fail.js takes the logo
      apart piece by piece. -#}
  <div class="wordmark hero-logo">{% set logoId = "hero" %}{% include "brand/logo-split.njk" %}{% include "brand/logo-sheen.njk" %}</div>
  <h1 class="hero-line rise-3">{{ t | w(wd.heading ~ "_thin") | rich(wd.heading ~ "_thin") }} <b>{{ t | w(wd.heading ~ "_bold") | rich(wd.heading ~ "_bold") }}</b></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub rise-3">{{ t | w(wd.text) | rich(wd.text) }}</p>
</div>
<div class="meter"><i></i></div>
</header>
